@startuml 答题捕获客户端顺序图
' 冉昕霖 · 第二阶段分析 · 客户端顺序图
' 正常主流程 + 超时恢复 + 答错分支；只出现客户端对象与后端接口
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #5B6B7C
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #F5F8FB
  ParticipantBorderColor #6F97B8
  ParticipantFontColor #1F2A37
  LifeLineBorderColor #B9C7D4
  GroupBorderColor #6F97B8
  GroupHeaderFontColor #1F3D57
}

actor 玩家 as P
participant "CapturePage\n答题界面" as Page
participant "CaptureController\n控制" as Ctrl
participant "CaptureApi\n捕获接口" as API
participant "ApiClient\nHTTP/信封" as HttpClient
participant "SessionStore\n会话" as Store
participant "捕获服务\n（后端）" as S

P -> Page : 点击「遇见攻城狮」
Page -> Ctrl : loadChallenge(spawnId)
Ctrl -> API : challenge(spawnId)
API -> HttpClient : post("/capture/challenge")
HttpClient -> Store : token()
Store --> HttpClient : token
HttpClient -> S : POST /api/v1/capture/challenge
S --> HttpClient : code=0, data={challenge...}
HttpClient --> API : data
API --> Ctrl : ChallengeView
Ctrl --> Page : 题干、选项、有效期

P -> Page : 选择选项
Page -> Ctrl : submit(optionId)
Ctrl -> Ctrl : 生成新 requestId；禁用提交
Ctrl -> API : answer(requestId, challengeId, optionId)
API -> HttpClient : post("/capture/answer")
HttpClient -> S : POST /api/v1/capture/answer

alt 正常返回
  S --> HttpClient : code=0, data={result...}
  HttpClient --> API : AnswerDto
  API --> Ctrl : CaptureResult
else 超时 / 连接中断
  HttpClient --> Ctrl : 网络未完成（不是业务失败）
  Ctrl -> API : status(challengeId)
  API -> S : GET /api/v1/capture/challenges/{id}
  alt status = CAPTURED
    S --> Ctrl : CAPTURED + captureRecordId
    Ctrl --> Page : 显示已捕获（不重复发奖）
  else status = OPEN
    S --> Ctrl : OPEN
    Ctrl -> API : answer(原 requestId, 同内容)
    API -> S : 重试同一请求
    S --> Ctrl : 首次处理结果（幂等回放）
  else 仍无法确认
    Ctrl --> Page : 结果待确认，提供重试
    note right of Ctrl : 客户端只在收到 CORRECT\n且 captureRecordId 非空时显示成功
  end
end

alt result = CORRECT
  Ctrl -> API : summary()
  API -> S : GET /api/v1/collection/summary
  S --> Ctrl : collectedSpeciesCount / captureCount
  Ctrl --> Page : 成功态 + 真实收藏数量
else result = WRONG
  Ctrl --> Page : 答错态，可重新作答
end

P -> Page : 返回地图
Page -> Ctrl : 刷新收藏概览
Ctrl -> API : summary()
API --> Page : CollectionSummary
@enduml
